ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6I6J6NOmtVYQ7kNvwFtzsae&_nc_oc=AdonJzZCvpSY1lKBYNTBJmy5xrsTFIUahsnZibLRy4P5utd9is3UiLbl6rw5wnE60JY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4gOod5hlPpPYmgMaXGoQ7C3bpzxn55Q8TkdJWUGb2CkQ&oe=6A0DB7B9"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0FH2qHElkm8Q7kNvwHzhkj9&_nc_oc=AdpPDYTbHPMsuOLHjq4_5vy0pp2Loh7oD_VfYg8pjYKzNBPKCj2gOhocN_bJAAG1FV8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4S1yupxsvF-HRAHs1g1Qhlg86efI5wJZuvPJFOijGZ-g&oe=6A0DA60F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XknOsz80US4Q7kNvwEfn_k0&_nc_oc=Ado8WPI5xvRespj6ow5w-mmz_UaNpplDFgGhEzFoHivnxK8WLGWJfd4vX__TvHZMdFw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af46Sj_8IhwX_2hv-MYbh-srbvaTNJKSTaNunPbUWy7O-g&oe=6A0DB3EE"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa